    "title": "Who among former West Contra Costa County area high school athletes will be active on Friday, Dec. 5? - West Contra Costa News",
    "text": "On Friday, Dec. 5, these former West Contra Costa County area high school stars will be competing.\nAce Robinson\nUNLV Rebels\nFreshman\n6′4″ 285\nDe La Salle High School\nHometown: Oakland\nNext Game: vs. Boise State Broncos, Friday, Dec. 5, 6 p.m.\nAlekai Afoa\nUNLV Rebels\nJunior\n6′4″ 285\nCalifornia High School\nHometown: San Ramon\nNext Game: vs. Boise State Broncos, Friday, Dec. 5, 6 p.m.\nBethel Imasuen\nBoise State Broncos\nFreshman\n6′4″ 290\nAcalanes High School\nNext Game: vs. UNLV Rebels, Friday, Dec. 5, 6 p.m.\nKarena Eberts\nColgate Raiders\nForward\nSophomore\n6′1″\nMiramonte High School\nHometown: Orinda\nNext Game: vs. Delaware Fightin’ Blue Hens, Friday, Dec. 5, 6 p.m.\nLogan Ketcham\nJames Madison Dukes\nSenior\n6′0″ 224\nAcalanes High School\nHometown: Lafayette\nNext Game: vs. Troy Trojans, Friday, Dec. 5, 6 p.m.",
